Purpose: Make the actual molded DS cross tilt toward the pressed direction,
not move flat as one undifferentiated button. Preserve GBA and native input.

Tasks:
- [x] Rock the shared cross once per paint from authoritative held inputs.
- [x] Combine diagonals, cancel opposite axes and spring back on release.
